# Build outputs
dist/
!packages/ui-bridge/dist/
# ui-bridge-eslint-plugin's dist/ is checked in so consumers (qontinui-mobile,
# qontinui-web, qontinui-supervisor frontend) can use the file:-protocol dep
# in CI without a build step. Until the plugin is published to npm, this is
# the simplest way to keep cross-repo `file:` deps resolvable.
!packages/ui-bridge-eslint-plugin/dist/
